R. Fradique Coutinho, 1240
https://www.google.com/maps/place/?q=place_id:ChIJo340ar1XzpQRLIpSoelC1CM]]></description><Point><coordinates>-46.6907671,-23.5567178,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
      <Placemark><name>Sede261</name><styleUrl>#bar</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[Bar de vinho natural — 4,1 (460) · $$ · Pinheiros
