    <Folder>
      <name>Santa Cecilia</name>
      <description>Borgo e Sotero sao vizinhos de porta.</description>
      <Placemark><name>Borgo Mooca</name><styleUrl>#resto</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[Italiano contemporaneo — 4,3 (2119) · $$$ · Santa Cecilia
